The '''Deputy Secretary General of the Secretariat Council''', ({{lang-bl|Subsecrétario General del Consejo de la Secretaría}}) is a  member of the [[Secretariat Council (Balisca)|Secretariat Council]]. The office is currently held by [[Fabrício Calazans]], under [[Zavier Bilal]]'s premiership.

Like most analogous offices in some other nations, the Deputy Secretary General assumes the duties and powers of the SecGen  in the latter's absence, illness, or death, such as representing the confederal administration both within Balisca and overseas. 

